* AD8237 Instrumentation Amplifier
.lib AD8237.lib

* Power Supply
V1 VCC 0 5
V2 REF 0 2.5

* Input Signal (Common-mode = 2.5V, Differential = 20mV amplitude at 1kHz)
V4 IN_M 0 2.5
V3 IN IN_M SINE(0 20m 1k) AC 1

* AD8237 Subcircuit Instantiation
* Pin order: +IN -IN BW -VS REF FB OUT +VS
X1 IN IN_M VCC 0 REF FB OUT VCC AD8237

* Gain Setting Resistors (Gain = 1 + R2/R1 = 10 V/V)
R1 FB REF 10k
R2 OUT FB 90k

* Analysis Directives
.tran 0 5m
.ac dec 10 10 100k

.end
